---
title: "Data sources - Bitcoin blockchain, Aggregation Service, Sidecar, and CAS/IPFS"
---

%% Each color is one data source. The icons are the same as in data-movement.mmd.
%% Arrows show who gets the data from each source.

flowchart LR
    classDef chain fill:#fff1dd,stroke:#f7931a,stroke-width:2px,color:#4a2a00
    classDef agg fill:#efe7fb,stroke:#7e57c2,stroke-width:2px,color:#2e1a4f
    classDef sidecar fill:#e3f4e6,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#123d17
    classDef cas fill:#e2eefb,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px,color:#0b2d55
    classDef actor fill:#f4f4f4,stroke:#555555,color:#111111

    Chain["<b>⛓ Bitcoin blockchain</b><br/>on-chain, public<br/><br/>⛓ Beacon Signal: 32 Signal Bytes<br/>Singleton: 🔖 hash of 🧾<br/>CAS: 🔖 hash of 🗺<br/>SMT: 🌲 SMT root<br/>block height, mediantime, confirmations"]:::chain

    Agg["<b>🤝 Aggregation Service</b><br/>to cohort participants only<br/><br/>🏷 Beacon Address + 🔑 cohort public keys<br/>📝 Unsigned Beacon Signal + 🎲 aggregated nonce<br/>🗺 CAS Announcement (CAS Beacon)<br/>🌲 SMT Proof (SMT Beacon)"]:::agg

    Sidecar["<b>🧳 Sidecar</b><br/>out of band, Stuart to Satoshi<br/><br/>🌱 Genesis Document (x1 DID)<br/>🧾 BTCR2 Signed Updates<br/>🗺 CAS Announcements<br/>🌲 SMT Proofs (only source for a resolver)"]:::sidecar

    CAS["<b>📦 CAS / IPFS</b><br/>off-chain, public<br/><br/>🌱 Genesis Document<br/>🧾 BTCR2 Signed Updates<br/>🗺 CAS Announcements<br/>(never 🌲 SMT Proofs)"]:::cas

    Stu(["Stuart<br/>(DID controller)"]):::actor
    Res(["Satoshi's resolver"]):::actor

    Chain -->|"⛓ confirmations of own Beacon Signal"| Stu
    Agg -->|"📝 🗺 🌲 during each round"| Stu
    Stu -->|"🧳 with the channel message"| Sidecar
    Stu -.->|"publish (optional)"| CAS
    Chain -->|"⛓ Beacon Signals"| Res
    Sidecar -->|"🧳 resolutionOptions.sidecar"| Res
    CAS -->|"🔖 get by hash if not in 🧳"| Res

